-Dispatch QM on `main` with the watchbill. Context MUST clear before QM.
+The "Remove stale nodes" loop in `render()` must only remove nodes whose IDs are NOT in the
+current filtered list, not all nodes.  After that, the update loop will find existing nodes
+and mutate them in place (classList.toggle, .checked, textContent) instead of recreating them.
 
